{"assets":["/statement-assets/ea335282af23e26b429af193e0b88124bff23bec7b1fd9e30e136a4bba945233.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1028","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Order book"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's consider a simplified version of order book of some stock. The order book is a list of orders (offers) from people that want to buy or sell one unit of the stock, each order is described by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"direction"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":") and price."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At every moment of time, every "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer has higher price than every "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In this problem no two ever existed orders will have the same price."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The lowest-price "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" order and the highest-price "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" order are called the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"best offers"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", marked with black frames on the picture below."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ea335282af23e26b429af193e0b88124bff23bec7b1fd9e30e136a4bba945233.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The presented order book says that someone wants to sell the product at price $$$12$$$ and it's the best "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer because the other two have higher prices. The best "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer has price $$$10$$$."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are two possible actions in this orderbook: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Somebody adds a new order of some direction with some price."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Somebody accepts the best possible "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer (makes a deal). It's impossible to accept not the best "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer (to make a deal at worse price). After someone accepts the offer, it is removed from the orderbook forever."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is allowed to add new "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" order only with prices less than the best "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer (if you want to buy stock for higher price, then instead of adding an order you should accept the best "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer). Similarly, one couldn't add a new "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" order with price less or equal to the best "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer. For example, you can't add a new offer \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$20$$$\" if there is already an offer \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$20$$$\" or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$25$$$\" — in this case you just accept the best "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" offer."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have a damaged order book log (in the beginning the are no orders in book). Every action has one of the two types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ADD"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$p$$$\" denotes adding a new order with price $$$p$$$ and unknown direction. The order must not contradict with orders still not removed from the order book. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ACCEPT"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$p$$$\" denotes accepting an existing best offer with price $$$p$$$ and unknown direction."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The directions of all actions are lost. Information from the log isn't always enough to determine these directions. Count the number of ways to correctly restore all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ADD"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" action directions so that all the described conditions are satisfied at any moment. Since the answer could be large, output it modulo $$$10^9 + 7$$$. If it is impossible to correctly restore directions, then output $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 363\\,304$$$) — the number of actions in the log."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains a string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ACCEPT"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ADD"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and an integer $$$p$$$ ($$$1 \\le p \\le 308\\,983\\,066$$$), describing an action type and price. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"All "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ADD"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" actions have different prices. For "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ACCEPT"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" action it is guaranteed that the order with the same price has already been added but has not been accepted yet."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output the number of ways to restore directions of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ADD"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" actions modulo $$$10^9 + 7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\nADD 1\nACCEPT 1\nADD 2\nACCEPT 2\nADD 3\nACCEPT 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"8\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\nADD 1\nADD 2\nADD 3\nACCEPT 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\nADD 1\nADD 2\nADD 3\nADD 4\nADD 5\nACCEPT 3\nACCEPT 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example each of orders may be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example the order with price $$$1$$$ has to be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BUY"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" order, the order with the price $$$3$$$ has to be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SELL"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1028D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1028/problem/D"}